  "notes": "## 0.10.0-alpha.2 - 2026-05-14\n\n### Features\n\n- Add a reset-and-start-over option on the unlock screen for users who forgot their passphrase.\n- Add background update downloads, including a setting to enable automatic downloads and clearer sidebar states for available, downloading, and ready-to-install updates.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Improve Windows quick panel paste reliability in apps where the previous input field did not regain focus correctly.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.10.0-alpha.2 - 2026-05-14\n\n### Features\n\n- 在解锁页面新增“重置并重新开始”入口，方便忘记口令的用户重新设置本机。\n- 新增后台下载更新能力，包括自动下载设置，以及侧边栏中更清晰的可更新、下载中和可安装状态。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 提升 Windows 快捷面板在部分应用中的自动粘贴可靠性，修复返回原输入框后焦点未正确恢复的问题。",
